r mansion  but when uncanny x-men number 160 comes  along and the x-men lock horns with  demonic velasco ileana is there to  suffer the consequences  velasco captures ileana and kitty pryde  aka  shadowcat as part of a plot to free  himself from the interdimensional realm  limbo by the end of the story the x-men  have saved both kitty and ileana  but things don't work out super well for  poor ileana as the team is being  teleported away  belasco grabs ileana from her brother's  arms  and yanks her back into limbo back on  earth kitty pride quickly reaches back  through a portal  grabs ileana and pulls her to safety but  peter's sister is seven years older than  she was on the previous page  it won't be until the 1983 miniseries  magic that we see what happened to  ileana in the interim  with the 1983 miniseries magic ileana  became the first  new mutant to get her own solo story  which helped explain what happened to  her during those missing seven years we  didn't get to see back in uncanny x-men  number 160.  the mini-series begins and ends with  iliana safe at xavier's winchester  mansion  and the story of her time in limbo  unfolds as a flashback  in these scenes iliana is pressed into  service of velasco  who hopes to use her as a means to  summon powerful elder gods  in the seven years she remains in limbo  ileana learns much from belasco  as well as alternate reality versions of  x-men particularly a duplicate of storm  in the interim her mutant ability to  create teleportation discs manifests  and the sorcerer skills she learns from  belasco grow powerful enough that she's  able to defeat the villain  during the mini-series we also see her  first manifestation as the powerful  soul sword as well as the first  emergence of the dark child  her dark demonic half many mutants are  defined by their innate powers but over  the years  iliana rasputin has proven so gifted  with her magical abilities  that it can be easy to forget that she  even has a mutant power  are you crazy that thing will kill you  he's right it's magic  iliana's mutant power is the ability to  create teleportation discs which allow  her to teleport herself  and others over great distances and even  through time  while most often used for practical  purposes like getting her friends out of  danger quickly  iliana is not above using her discs as  weapons  in 2019's uncanny x-men number 20 for  example  she kills the alternate reality mutant  dark beast by teleporting him so that  his head reappears in a ceiling  but iliana's magical abilities have  often proven impressive enough to  outshine her mutant powers  her soul sword and the mystical armor  that manifests with it are extremely  powerful on their own  particularly against magical targets and  her dark child form is extremely  formidable  she's the sorcerer supreme of limbo the  same title dr  strange wields in marvel's home  dimension and the eye of agamotto  identifies her as one possible candidate  to replace dr strange  as earth sorcerer supreme in 2009's new  avengers number 53.  we've already talked about that time  when ileana rasputin aged seven years in  a single comic  but that isn't the last time fate plays  havoc with magic's age  in 1989's new mutants number 73  as part of the line wide event inferno  ileana has her years in limbo  and with the new mutants taken from her  see ileana transforms into her demonic  self  the dark child but eventually ascends to  what wolf's bane calls a being of light  or a light child as a result colossus  and the new mutants believe she's dead  within her mystical armor  until they hear her voice calling for  help colossus tears the armor open to  find her six-year-old self  waiting inside from that point forward  iliana remains a child for several years  of x-men stories  until her tragic death in 1993's uncanny  x-men number 303  a number of rulers in marvel comics have  double duty as superhero and world  leader  and magic also walks that line however  iliana has something of a unique  responsibility among marvel's rulers in  that she claims control not over a  nation  or even a world but the entire dimension  of limbo  sometimes it depends with the help of  her demon lieutenant  sim ileana takes control over limbo from  belasco  but holding on to limbo continually  proves to be a tricky prospect  when your servants are demons your  servants all want your throne and  throughout her time in the new mutants  iliana is forced to fight against the  rebellious sim in 1988's uncanny x-men  number 231  she unwittingly summons her brother  colossus who she believes to be dead  to help her fight sim and his forces  then symbolize with another demon to  help defeat magic in the 1989 line-wide  event  inferno which helps lead to magic being  de-aged to childhood  but even that wasn't the end of the  struggle one of the most recent examples  of how tough it is to be a demon queen  is in 2013's uncanny x-men  when magic and the x-men fight off an  attempt by the powerful  dormammu and his hordes of mindless ones  to take over limbo  magic is ultimately forced to in her  words end  limbo by mystically drawing the  dimension into herself  and eventually remaking it you could  argue  all of us have a so-called dark half but  in the case of magic  her dark side manifests as a literally  separate  destructive being she's had different  names like dark soul and dark child but  whatever you call it  iliana's dark self gets closer to the  surface the more iliana uses her magic  i killed 18 men one by  one when she summons her soul sword for  example  usually a magical armor will appear  along with it  and the percentage of her body covered  by the armor grows steadily as she uses  more power  if she wields enough sorcery she  manifests other devil-like physical  attributes  like horns sprouting from her forehead  and cloven hooves replacing her feet  in spite of its power the dark child  often proves to not only be magic's  greatest weakness  but something her enemies can use  against her friends  characters such as the godlike beyonder  and the asgardian sorceress  enchantress have sometimes managed to  force the dark child to the surface to  use against magic's allies  and in the case of enchantress in 1985's  new mutant special edition number one  she physically separated dark child from  iliana to remove any and all-tempering  goodness from the mightier demon half  it isn't until 1984's magic number four  that we get to see the very first time  ileana creates her  famous soul sword as part of a spell she  cast to gain  vengeance for the death of her friend  the limbo duplicate of storm  however publication wise the soul sword  first appears in 1983's uncanny x-men  number 171  when iliana panics as she remembers her  experiences in limbo  her best friend kitty pryde aka shadow  cat calms her down  but not before magic cuts kitty's cheek  something that shocks kitty because she  was using her  phasing power to become intangible at  the time the soul sword has since been a  staple of magic stories and she's rarely  seen in battle without it  the sword boosts her mystic might and  wielding it usually summons a powerful  accompanying armor  for the most part the soul sword damages  creatures of mystic origin  though non-mystical and even intangible  characters have also been affected by  the blade  unlike a more physical weapon like  thor's mjolnir magic carries the weapon  within herself  the outward appearance of the soul sword  is always changing  when it first appears the soul sword  doesn't look particularly unique  but in more recent years the sword has  grown in size until its massive girth  looks more like what you'd expect cloud  to be swinging in final fantasy vii  for close to a decade the mutant legacy  virus  rampaged through marvel's mutant  population and the first hero to succumb  to the illness  was ileana rasputin having been reverted  to the age of six by the end of 1989's  new mutants number 73  magic is still a little girl when she  grows ill attempts are made to cure her  but nothing bears fruit with jubilee by  her bedside  iliana's life slips away in the  emotional story of 1993's uncanny x-men  number 303  in the wake of her death colossus  briefly leaves the x-men  and joins forces with magneto and the  ironclad hero eventually sacrifices  himself to eradicate the virus that  killed his sister  in 2001's uncanny x-men number 390.  of course both ileana and her brother  eventually returned to the land of the  living because no one really stays dead  in superhero comics  [Music]  someone call it ambulance  oh god oh my god well almost no one  hostilities break out between two of  marvel's most beloved teams in 2012's  line wide event and accompanying  miniseries  avengers vs x-men the feud is all over  the impending return of the destructive  phoenix force  in an attempt to stop the entity the  avengers inadvertently disperse it  between five mutants  cyclops emma frost namor colossus  and magic who become known as the  phoenix five  at first the five seem to want to use  their new godlike powers only to help  the world  but eventually their newfound might  corrupts them magic and colossus work  hand in hand as part of the phoenix 5  both before and after they turn their  attention to destroying the avengers  unsurprisingly considering her darker  leanings magic proves just a bit more  committed to their course  in avengers versus x-men number seven  she tries but  fails to murder scarlet witch two issues  later both she and her brother lose  their power after beating spider-man  nearly to death  at first they begin arguing because  magic is annoyed at her brother's  hesitance toward killing spidey  and that's when peter parker uses the  opportunity to provoke them both  as a result magic and colossus strike  each other  driving the phoenix force out of both  their bodies in the process  after the event which eventually  includes the death of professor x at  cyclops's hands  iliana doesn't seem particularly  remorseful over her involvement  she joins cyclops emma frost and magneto  in their fugitive team of x-men  for a long time the question of magic  sexuality has been up in the air  she rarely if ever has shown interest in  romance leaving some fans to theorize  she might be asexual  when marvel's xbooks were revived in  2019 though  it included a revival of new mutants and  in 2020's new mutants number five  iliana seems to be like fellow marvel  hero deadpool  pansexual as the new mutants confront  the shia  death commandos magic takes on three of  them all on her own  but before fighting them she asks each  one of them whether or not they want to  make out with her  whether the scene was mostly comedic or  a glimpse at magic's deeper feelings  it definitely seems that magic is open  to a lot of possibilities  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite superheroes are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

